{"chars": "Snowbell is small, even for an elf. She has deep brown skin and two long silver-white braids that swing when she moves, and there are almost always little curls of paper caught in them. On her nose she wears spectacles made of frost-crystal, which sparkle when she reads and always sit a tiny bit crooked. She wears a cozy blue cardigan with deep pockets stuffed full of pencils, bookmarks and scraps of paper with notes on them. Like every elf, she has a bell on the tip of her knitted cap, but hers is wrapped in a little puff of wool, so that it goes plink instead of jingle and never disturbs anyone who is reading.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 0.863, 1.35, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.425, 1.75, 1.75, 1.75, 1.75, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 2.625, 2.737, 2.737, 2.737, 2.737, 2.888, 2.888, 2.888, 2.888, 3.062, 3.062, 3.062, 3.062, 3.062, 3.325, 3.325, 3.325, 3.325, 3.325, 3.325, 3.65, 3.65, 3.65, 3.65, 3.65, 4.025, 4.025, 4.025, 4.025, 4.162, 4.162, 4.162, 4.162, 4.4, 4.4, 4.4, 4.4, 4.4, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.938, 5.938, 5.938, 5.938, 5.938, 5.938, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.4, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 7.25, 7.35, 7.35, 7.35, 7.35, 7.463, 7.463, 7.463, 7.463, 7.463, 7.463, 7.562, 7.562, 7.562, 7.562, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 7.638, 8.0, 8.0, 8.0, 8.0, 8.0, 8.0, 8.0, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.988, 8.988, 8.988, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 10.45, 10.55, 10.55, 10.55, 10.688, 10.688, 10.688, 10.688, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 11.287, 11.287, 11.287, 11.287, 11.425, 11.425, 11.425, 11.42